        "original_id": "1907e087-b681-51b1-a17f-d4d237668840",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Green on Red, Hollywood Undead\n- People: Dan Stuart, Chris Cacavas, Alex MacNicol, Jack Waterson\n- Places: Tucson, Arizona; Los Angeles, California\n- Music scenes and movements: Tucson punk scene, Paisley Underground\n- Albums: Gravity Talks\n\nFacts:\n- Green on Red was an American rock band formed in the Tucson, Arizona punk scene.\n- Green on Red was based for most of its career in Los Angeles, California.\n- Green on Red was loosely associated with the Paisley Underground.\n- In 2005, Hollywood Undead was formed in Los Angeles, California.\n- Hollywood Undead is an American rap rock band.\n- All songs on Gravity Talks were written by Dan Stuart, Chris Cacavas, Alex MacNicol, and Jack Waterson.",
